{"PubTator3": [{"_id": "32957588|PMC7563793", "id": "7563793", "infons": {}, "passages": [{"infons": {"name_3": "surname:Libi;given-names:Fabio", "name_2": "surname:De Marchis;given-names:Laura", "name_1": "surname:Petrucci;given-names:Simona", "name_0": "surname:Germani;given-names:Aldo", "year": "2020", "article-id_publisher-id": "jcm-09-03003", "article-id_doi": "10.3390/jcm9093003", "type": "front", "section_type": "TITLE", "issue": "9", "elocation-id": "3003", "volume": "9", "license": "Licensee MDPI, Basel, Switzerland. This article is an open access article distributed under the terms and conditions of the Creative Commons Attribution (CC BY) license (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).", "name_10": "surname:Maggi;given-names:Stefano", "name_13": "surname:Pellegrini;given-names:Patrizia", "name_14": "surname:Speranza;given-names:Annarita", "name_11": "surname:Mattei;given-names:Mauro", "name_12": "surname:Osti;given-names:Mattia Falchetto", "name_17": "surname:Pizzuti;given-names:Antonio", "kwd": "hereditary breast/ovarian cancer pancreatic cancer next-generation sequencing gene panel DNA repair genes", "name_18": "surname:Torrisi;given-names:Maria Rosaria", "name_15": "surname:Stanzani;given-names:Gianluca", "name_9": "surname:Lombardi;given-names:Augusto", "name_16": "surname:Vitale;given-names:Valeria", "name_8": "surname:Capalbo;given-names:Carlo", "name_7": "surname:Campanella;given-names:Barbara", "name_6": "surname:Bonifacino;given-names:Adriana", "name_19": "surname:Piane;given-names:Maria", "name_5": "surname:Amanti;given-names:Claudio", "name_4": "surname:Savio;given-names:Camilla", "article-id_pmc": "7563793", "article-id_pmid": "32957588"}, "offset": 0, "text": "Beyond BRCA1 and BRCA2: Deleterious Variants in DNA Repair Pathway Genes in Italian Families with Breast/Ovarian and Pancreatic Cancers", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37807", "infons": {"identifier": "672", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "5276", "valid": true, "normalized": [672], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 672, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA1", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA1"}, "text": "BRCA1", "locations": [{"offset": 7, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37808", "infons": {"identifier": "675", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "41", "valid": true, "normalized": [675], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 675, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA2", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA2"}, "text": "BRCA2", "locations": [{"offset": 17, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37809", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "Breast/Ovarian and Pancreatic Cancers", "locations": [{"offset": 98, "length": 37}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "ABSTRACT", "type": "abstract"}, "offset": 136, "text": "The 5-10% of breast/ovarian cancers (BC and OC) are inherited, and germline pathogenic (P) variants in DNA damage repair (DDR) genes BRCA1 and BRCA2 explain only 10-20% of these cases. Currently, new DDR genes have been related to BC/OC and to pancreatic (PC) cancers, but the prevalence of P variants remains to be explored. The purpose of this study was to investigate the spectrum and the prevalence of pathogenic variants in DDR pathway genes other than BRCA1/2 and to correlate the genotype with the clinical phenotype. A cohort of 113 non-BRCA patients was analyzed by next-generation sequencing using a multigene panel of the 25 DDR pathways genes related to BC, OC, and PC. We found 43 unique variants in 18 of 25 analyzed genes, 14 classified as P/likely pathogenic (LP) and 28 as variants of uncertain significance (VUS). Deleterious variants were identified in 14% of index cases, whereas a VUS was identified in 20% of the probands. We observed a high incidence of deleterious variants in the CHEK2 gene, and a new pathogenic variant was detected in the RECQL gene. These results supported the clinical utility of multigene panel to increase the detection of P/LP carriers and to identify new actionable pathogenic gene variants useful for preventive and therapeutic approaches.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37810", "infons": {"identifier": "672", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "5276", "valid": true, "normalized": [672], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 672, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA1", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA1"}, "text": "BRCA1", "locations": [{"offset": 269, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37811", "infons": {"identifier": "675", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "41", "valid": true, "normalized": [675], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 675, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA2", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA2"}, "text": "BRCA2", "locations": [{"offset": 279, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37812", "infons": {"identifier": "11200", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "38289", "valid": true, "normalized": [11200], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 11200, "biotype": "gene", "name": "CHEK2", "accession": "@GENE_CHEK2"}, "text": "CHEK2", "locations": [{"offset": 1141, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37813", "infons": {"identifier": "5965", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "56279", "valid": true, "normalized": [5965], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5965, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RECQL", "accession": "@GENE_RECQL"}, "text": "RECQL", "locations": [{"offset": 1202, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37814", "infons": {"identifier": "672", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "5276", "valid": true, "normalized": [672], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 672, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA1", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA1"}, "text": "BRCA", "locations": [{"offset": 681, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37815", "infons": {"identifier": "5744", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "2113", "valid": true, "normalized": [5744], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5744, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PTHLH", "accession": "@GENE_PTHLH"}, "text": "P/LP", "locations": [{"offset": 1307, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37816", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 806, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37817", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC/OC", "locations": [{"offset": 367, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37818", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 802, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37819", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 173, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37820", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patients", "locations": [{"offset": 686, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "37821", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D061325", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D061325"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D061325", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Hereditary Breast and Ovarian Cancer Syndrome", "accession": "@DISEASE_Hereditary_Breast_and_Ovarian_Cancer_Syndrome"}, "text": "breast/ovarian cancers", "locations": [{"offset": 149, "length": 22}]}, {"id": "37823", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 180, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37824", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010190", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010190"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010190", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Pancreatic Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Pancreatic_Neoplasms"}, "text": "pancreatic (PC) cancers", "locations": [{"offset": 380, "length": 23}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "INTRO", "type": "title_1"}, "offset": 1431, "text": "1. Introduction", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "INTRO", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 1447, "text": "Hereditary breast, ovarian, and pancreatic cancers are associated with the presence of germline pathogenic (P) or likely pathogenic (LP) variants in the BRCA1 and BRCA2 genes. However, damaging mutations in these two genes justify no more than 20% of familial forms of these malignancies. As the remaining 80% is still waiting for genetic diagnosis, the discovery of new genes involved in the susceptibility of hereditary cancers is under continuous investigation. The identification of pathogenic variants in other genes at both a germline and somatic is, therefore, crucial for the future of primary prevention strategies (prophylactic surgery and drug-prevention), surveillance programs, and targeted therapy. In this scenario, the research of hereditary breast/ovarian cancer susceptibility genes is crucial.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37826", "infons": {"identifier": "672", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "5276", "valid": true, "normalized": [672], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 672, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA1", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA1"}, "text": "BRCA1", "locations": [{"offset": 1600, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37827", "infons": {"identifier": "675", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "41", "valid": true, "normalized": [675], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 675, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA2", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA2"}, "text": "BRCA2", "locations": [{"offset": 1610, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37828", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "malignancies", "locations": [{"offset": 1722, "length": 12}]}, {"id": "37829", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D061325", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D061325"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D061325", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Hereditary Breast and Ovarian Cancer Syndrome", "accession": "@DISEASE_Hereditary_Breast_and_Ovarian_Cancer_Syndrome"}, "text": "Hereditary breast, ovarian, and pancreatic cancers", "locations": [{"offset": 1447, "length": 50}]}, {"id": "37830", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D061325", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D061325"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D061325", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Hereditary Breast and Ovarian Cancer Syndrome", "accession": "@DISEASE_Hereditary_Breast_and_Ovarian_Cancer_Syndrome"}, "text": "hereditary breast/ovarian cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 2194, "length": 32}]}, {"id": "37831", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009386", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009386"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009386", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplastic Syndromes Hereditary", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplastic_Syndromes_Hereditary"}, "text": "hereditary cancers", "locations": [{"offset": 1858, "length": 18}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "INTRO", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 2260, "text": "BRCA1/2 have been primarily investigated for diagnostic purposes because their mutations show high penetrance, conferring the 5-fold higher risk of breast cancer in P/LP variant carriers compared to the general population.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37832", "infons": {"identifier": "5744", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "2113", "valid": true, "normalized": [5744], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5744, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PTHLH", "accession": "@GENE_PTHLH"}, "text": "P/LP", "locations": [{"offset": 2425, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37833", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "breast cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 2408, "length": 13}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "INTRO", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 2483, "text": "BRCA1 and BRCA2 play a crucial role in the DNA double-strand break repair (DSBR) machinery by homologous recombination (HR). In this highly conserved mechanism, they interact with different proteins, including ATM, a master kinase acting upstream in the genome surveillance pathway, mainly activated by double-strand breaks (DSBs); MRN complex (MRE11, NBN, RAD50), able to detect DSBs; CHEK2 that allows DNA repair by arresting the cell cycle at the G1/S checkpoint; BARD1 and BRIP1, which interact with BRCA1 at N and C-terminal regions, respectively; PALB2 and the paralog RAD51C and RAD51D, all involved in the BRCA complexes required for HR, and LKB1, encoded by STK11, which co-localizes with ATM and BRCA1 at the sites of the DNA damage. All of these DBSR genes have been already associated with hereditary breast/ovarian and pancreatic cancers, as well as colon and gastric cancers (CC and GC). In addition, other genes involved in DNA damage repair (DDR) pathways different from HR and cell cycle control, such as APC, CDH1, CDK4, CDKN2A, PTEN, SMAD4, TP53, and the DNA helicase RECQL, have been associated with high or moderate susceptibility to familial breast cancer (BC) and other types of malignancies.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37834", "infons": {"identifier": "672", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "5276", "valid": true, "normalized": [672], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 672, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA1", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA1"}, "text": "BRCA1", "locations": [{"offset": 2483, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37835", "infons": {"identifier": "675", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "41", "valid": true, "normalized": [675], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 675, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA2", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA2"}, "text": "BRCA2", "locations": [{"offset": 2493, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37836", "infons": {"identifier": "472", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "30952", "valid": true, "normalized": [472], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 472, "biotype": "gene", "name": "ATM", "accession": "@GENE_ATM"}, "text": "ATM", "locations": [{"offset": 2693, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37837", "infons": {"identifier": "4361", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "4083", "valid": true, "normalized": [4361], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4361, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MRE11", "accession": "@GENE_MRE11"}, "text": "MRE11", "locations": [{"offset": 2828, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37838", "infons": {"identifier": "4683", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "1858", "valid": true, "normalized": [4683], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4683, "biotype": "gene", "name": "NBN", "accession": "@GENE_NBN"}, "text": "NBN", "locations": [{"offset": 2835, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37839", "infons": {"identifier": "10111", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "38092", "valid": true, "normalized": [10111], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 10111, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RAD50", "accession": "@GENE_RAD50"}, "text": "RAD50", "locations": [{"offset": 2840, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37840", "infons": {"identifier": "11200", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "38289", "valid": true, "normalized": [11200], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 11200, "biotype": "gene", "name": "CHEK2", "accession": "@GENE_CHEK2"}, "text": "CHEK2", "locations": [{"offset": 2869, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37841", "infons": {"identifier": "580", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "400", "valid": true, "normalized": [580], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 580, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BARD1", "accession": "@GENE_BARD1"}, "text": "BARD1", "locations": [{"offset": 2950, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37842", "infons": {"identifier": "83990", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "32766", "valid": true, "normalized": [83990], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 83990, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRIP1", "accession": "@GENE_BRIP1"}, "text": "BRIP1", "locations": [{"offset": 2960, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37843", "infons": {"identifier": "672", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "5276", "valid": true, "normalized": [672], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 672, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA1", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA1"}, "text": "BRCA1", "locations": [{"offset": 2987, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37844", "infons": {"identifier": "79728", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "11652", "valid": true, "normalized": [79728], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 79728, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PALB2", "accession": "@GENE_PALB2"}, "text": "PALB2", "locations": [{"offset": 3036, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37845", "infons": {"identifier": "5889", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "14238", "valid": true, "normalized": [5889], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5889, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RAD51C", "accession": "@GENE_RAD51C"}, "text": "RAD51C", "locations": [{"offset": 3058, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "37846", "infons": {"identifier": "5892", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "2156", "valid": true, "normalized": [5892], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5892, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RAD51D", "accession": "@GENE_RAD51D"}, "text": "RAD51D", "locations": [{"offset": 3069, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "37847", "infons": {"identifier": "672", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "5276", "valid": true, "normalized": [672], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 672, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA1", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA1"}, "text": "BRCA", "locations": [{"offset": 3097, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37848", "infons": {"identifier": "6794", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "393", "valid": true, "normalized": [6794], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 6794, "biotype": "gene", "name": "STK11", "accession": "@GENE_STK11"}, "text": "LKB1", "locations": [{"offset": 3133, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37849", "infons": {"identifier": "6794", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "393", "valid": true, "normalized": [6794], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 6794, "biotype": "gene", "name": "STK11", "accession": "@GENE_STK11"}, "text": "STK11", "locations": [{"offset": 3150, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37850", "infons": {"identifier": "472", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "30952", "valid": true, "normalized": [472], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 472, "biotype": "gene", "name": "ATM", "accession": "@GENE_ATM"}, "text": "ATM", "locations": [{"offset": 3181, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37851", "infons": {"identifier": "672", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "5276", "valid": true, "normalized": [672], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 672, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA1", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA1"}, "text": "BRCA1", "locations": [{"offset": 3189, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37852", "infons": {"identifier": "324", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "30950", "valid": true, "normalized": [324], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 324, "biotype": "gene", "name": "APC", "accession": "@GENE_APC"}, "text": "APC", "locations": [{"offset": 3505, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37853", "infons": {"identifier": "999", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "20917", "valid": true, "normalized": [999], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 999, "biotype": "gene", "name": "CDH1", "accession": "@GENE_CDH1"}, "text": "CDH1", "locations": [{"offset": 3510, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37854", "infons": {"identifier": "1019", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "55429", "valid": true, "normalized": [1019], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 1019, "biotype": "gene", "name": "CDK4", "accession": "@GENE_CDK4"}, "text": "CDK4", "locations": [{"offset": 3516, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37855", "infons": {"identifier": "1029", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "55430", "valid": true, "normalized": [1029], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 1029, "biotype": "gene", "name": "CDKN2A", "accession": "@GENE_CDKN2A"}, "text": "CDKN2A", "locations": [{"offset": 3522, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "37856", "infons": {"identifier": "5728", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "265", "valid": true, "normalized": [5728], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5728, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PTEN", "accession": "@GENE_PTEN"}, "text": "PTEN", "locations": [{"offset": 3530, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37857", "infons": {"identifier": "4089", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "31310", "valid": true, "normalized": [4089], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4089, "biotype": "gene", "name": "SMAD4", "accession": "@GENE_SMAD4"}, "text": "SMAD4", "locations": [{"offset": 3536, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37858", "infons": {"identifier": "7157", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "460", "valid": true, "normalized": [7157], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 7157, "biotype": "gene", "name": "TP53", "accession": "@GENE_TP53"}, "text": "TP53", "locations": [{"offset": 3543, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37859", "infons": {"identifier": "5965", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "56279", "valid": true, "normalized": [5965], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5965, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RECQL", "accession": "@GENE_RECQL"}, "text": "RECQL", "locations": [{"offset": 3570, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37860", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "familial breast cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 3638, "length": 22}]}, {"id": "37861", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "malignancies", "locations": [{"offset": 3685, "length": 12}]}, {"id": "37862", "infons": {"type": "Disease", "valid": false, "normalized_id": null, "biotype": "disease"}, "text": "CC", "locations": [{"offset": 3373, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37863", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D061325", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D061325"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D061325", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Hereditary Breast and Ovarian Cancer Syndrome", "accession": "@DISEASE_Hereditary_Breast_and_Ovarian_Cancer_Syndrome"}, "text": "hereditary breast/ovarian and pancreatic cancers", "locations": [{"offset": 3285, "length": 48}]}, {"id": "37864", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 3662, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37865", "infons": {"type": "Disease", "valid": false, "normalized_id": null, "biotype": "disease"}, "text": "GC", "locations": [{"offset": 3380, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37866", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D013274", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D013274"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D013274", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Stomach Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Stomach_Neoplasms"}, "text": "colon and gastric cancers", "locations": [{"offset": 3346, "length": 25}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "INTRO", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 3699, "text": "Next-generation sequencing (NGS) studies have recently demonstrated that some genes causing hereditary gastrointestinal cancer syndromes are risk factors for breast, ovarian, and pancreatic cancers. Indeed, P/LP variants in the mismatch repair (MMR) genes, such as MSH2, MLH1, MSH6, PMS2, and EPCAM, classically associated to hereditary colon and endometrial cancers (Lynch Syndrome), have also been identified in the breast, ovarian, biliary, and gastric tumors. MUTYH, a gene involved in the DDR by base excision repair (BER) and responsible for the autosomal recessive form of familial colorectal cancer polyposis, has been recently proposed as a risk factor for breast cancer in males.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37867", "infons": {"identifier": "4436", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "210", "valid": true, "normalized": [4436], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4436, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MSH2", "accession": "@GENE_MSH2"}, "text": "MSH2", "locations": [{"offset": 3964, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37868", "infons": {"identifier": "4292", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "208", "valid": true, "normalized": [4292], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4292, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MLH1", "accession": "@GENE_MLH1"}, "text": "MLH1", "locations": [{"offset": 3970, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37869", "infons": {"identifier": "2956", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "149", "valid": true, "normalized": [2956], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 2956, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MSH6", "accession": "@GENE_MSH6"}, "text": "MSH6", "locations": [{"offset": 3976, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37870", "infons": {"identifier": "5395", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "133560", "valid": true, "normalized": [5395], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5395, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PMS2", "accession": "@GENE_PMS2"}, "text": "PMS2", "locations": [{"offset": 3982, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37871", "infons": {"identifier": "4072", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "1764", "valid": true, "normalized": [4072], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4072, "biotype": "gene", "name": "EPCAM", "accession": "@GENE_EPCAM"}, "text": "EPCAM", "locations": [{"offset": 3992, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37872", "infons": {"identifier": "4595", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "8156", "valid": true, "normalized": [4595], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4595, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MUTYH", "accession": "@GENE_MUTYH"}, "text": "MUTYH", "locations": [{"offset": 4163, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37873", "infons": {"identifier": "5744", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "2113", "valid": true, "normalized": [5744], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5744, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PTHLH", "accession": "@GENE_PTHLH"}, "text": "P/LP", "locations": [{"offset": 3906, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37874", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "breast cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 4365, "length": 13}]}, {"id": "37875", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "breast, ovarian, biliary, and gastric tumors", "locations": [{"offset": 4117, "length": 44}]}, {"id": "37876", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D015179", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D015179"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D015179", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Colorectal Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Colorectal_Neoplasms"}, "text": "familial colorectal cancer polyposis", "locations": [{"offset": 4279, "length": 36}]}, {"id": "37877", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D003123", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D003123"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D003123", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Colorectal Neoplasms Hereditary Nonpolyposis", "accession": "@DISEASE_Colorectal_Neoplasms_Hereditary_Nonpolyposis"}, "text": "Lynch Syndrome", "locations": [{"offset": 4067, "length": 14}]}, {"id": "37878", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009386", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009386"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009386", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplastic Syndromes Hereditary", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplastic_Syndromes_Hereditary"}, "text": "hereditary gastrointestinal cancer syndromes", "locations": [{"offset": 3791, "length": 44}]}, {"id": "37879", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "breast, ovarian, and pancreatic cancers", "locations": [{"offset": 3857, "length": 39}]}, {"id": "37880", "infons": {"identifier": "-", "type": "Chemical", "valid": false, "normalized_id": null, "biotype": "chemical"}, "text": "base", "locations": [{"offset": 4200, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37881", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D015179", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D015179"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D015179", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Colorectal Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Colorectal_Neoplasms"}, "text": "colon and endometrial cancers", "locations": [{"offset": 4036, "length": 29}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "INTRO", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 4389, "text": "The identification of P/LP variants in DDR and cycle cell genes is becoming one of the main goals of the oncology clinical research. Alterations in these genes are emerging as novel targets for treatment in different cancers and, particularly, for personalized therapies. PARP (Poly(ADP-ribose) Polymerase)-inhibitors, for instance, have been introduced in the treatment of BRCA and, more recently, of other HR deficiency-related malignancies with encouraging results.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37883", "infons": {"identifier": "142", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "1222", "valid": true, "normalized": [142], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 142, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PARP1", "accession": "@GENE_PARP1"}, "text": "PARP", "locations": [{"offset": 4661, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37884", "infons": {"identifier": "142", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "1222", "valid": true, "normalized": [142], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 142, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PARP1", "accession": "@GENE_PARP1"}, "text": "Poly(ADP-ribose) Polymerase", "locations": [{"offset": 4667, "length": 27}]}, {"id": "37885", "infons": {"identifier": "672", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "5276", "valid": true, "normalized": [672], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 672, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA1", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA1"}, "text": "BRCA", "locations": [{"offset": 4763, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37886", "infons": {"identifier": "5744", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "2113", "valid": true, "normalized": [5744], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5744, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PTHLH", "accession": "@GENE_PTHLH"}, "text": "P/LP", "locations": [{"offset": 4411, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37887", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "malignancies", "locations": [{"offset": 4819, "length": 12}]}, {"id": "37888", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "cancers", "locations": [{"offset": 4606, "length": 7}]}, {"id": "37889", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:C535296", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["C535296"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "C535296", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Recombinant chromosome 8 syndrome", "accession": "@DISEASE_Recombinant_chromosome_8_syndrome"}, "text": "HR deficiency", "locations": [{"offset": 4797, "length": 13}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "INTRO", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 4858, "text": "To date, however, the prevalence of germline mutations in non-BRCA DDR genes is partially investigated in BC, ovarian cancer (OC), and pancreatic cancer (PC), and available data about these genetic risk factors in cancer disease are still poor.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37890", "infons": {"identifier": "672", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "5276", "valid": true, "normalized": [672], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 672, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA1", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA1"}, "text": "BRCA", "locations": [{"offset": 4920, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37891", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 4984, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37892", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010195", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010195"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010195", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Pancreatitis", "accession": "@DISEASE_Pancreatitis"}, "text": "PC", "locations": [{"offset": 5012, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37893", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 4964, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37894", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "ovarian cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 4968, "length": 14}]}, {"id": "37895", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "cancer disease", "locations": [{"offset": 5072, "length": 14}]}, {"id": "37896", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010190", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010190"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010190", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Pancreatic Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Pancreatic_Neoplasms"}, "text": "pancreatic cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 4993, "length": 17}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "INTRO", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 5103, "text": "By applying NGS technologies, we analyzed 25 genes involved in DDR and in the cell cycle control in a cohort of 113 non-BRCA patients with personal and/or family history of BC, OC, and/or PC. This study aimed at (1) broadening the mutational spectrum and better defining the prevalence of P/LP variants in non-BRCA cancer-related genes, (2) evaluating the clinical utility of the multigene panel, (3) identifying novel actionable variants, and (4) improving the efficiency of clinical diagnostic tests.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37897", "infons": {"identifier": "672", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "5276", "valid": true, "normalized": [672], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 672, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA1", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA1"}, "text": "BRCA", "locations": [{"offset": 5223, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37898", "infons": {"identifier": "5744", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "2113", "valid": true, "normalized": [5744], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5744, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PTHLH", "accession": "@GENE_PTHLH"}, "text": "P/LP", "locations": [{"offset": 5392, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37900", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010195", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010195"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010195", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Pancreatitis", "accession": "@DISEASE_Pancreatitis"}, "text": "PC", "locations": [{"offset": 5291, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37901", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 5280, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37902", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patients", "locations": [{"offset": 5228, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "37903", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BRCA cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 5413, "length": 11}]}, {"id": "37904", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 5276, "length": 2}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "METHODS", "type": "title_1"}, "offset": 5606, "text": "2. Material and Methods", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "METHODS", "type": "title_2"}, "offset": 5630, "text": "2.1. Patients", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "METHODS", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 5644, "text": "From January 2017 to December 2019, 733 unrelated patients with personal and/or familial history of BC, OC, PC attended the UOC of Medical Genetics and Advanced Cellular Diagnostics of the Department of Clinical and Molecular Medicine (Sant'Andrea University Hospital of Rome) for BRCA1/2 molecular testing, according to the American National Comprehensive Cancer Network (NCCN) Guidelines and/or the \"Regione Lazio DCA 52/201\" criteria (N. U00189 del 31 May 2017). Among them, 113 probands without P/LP BRCA variants, who satisfied the NCCN testing criteria for the multigene panel, were selected . After dedicated genetic counseling, clinical data, including personal and family history, were collected by medical records and personal interviews, and the molecular analysis of 25 cancer-related genes, performed with a multigene cancer panel, was proposed. The study complied with the ethical standards of the Declaration of Helsinki and was reviewed and approved by the institutional ethics committee. Written informed consent was obtained from all participants.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37905", "infons": {"identifier": "672", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "5276", "valid": true, "normalized": [672], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 672, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRCA1", "accession": "@GENE_BRCA1"}, "text": "BRCA", "locations": [{"offset": 6148, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37906", "infons": {"identifier": "5744", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "2113", "valid": true, "normalized": [5744], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5744, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PTHLH", "accession": "@GENE_PTHLH"}, "text": "P/LP", "locations": [{"offset": 6143, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37907", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010195", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010195"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010195", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Pancreatitis", "accession": "@DISEASE_Pancreatitis"}, "text": "PC", "locations": [{"offset": 5752, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37908", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 6475, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "37909", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 6426, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "37910", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 5744, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37911", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patients", "locations": [{"offset": 5694, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "37912", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:|DEL|00189|31;HGVS:c.00189del31;VariantGroup:72;CorrespondingGene:5744;CorrespondingSpecies:9606", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "DNAMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "c.00189del31", "gene_ids": [5744], "gene_id": 5744, "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "rsids": [], "normalized": ["#5744#c.00189del31", "#5744#"], "normalized_id": "#5744#c.00189del31", "biotype": "variant", "name": "c.00189del31", "accession": "@VARIANT_c.00189del31_PTHLH_human"}, "text": "00189 del 31", "locations": [{"offset": 6086, "length": 12}]}, {"id": "37913", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 5748, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37914", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "Cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 6001, "length": 6}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "METHODS", "type": "title_2"}, "offset": 6718, "text": "2.2. NGS Sequencing", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "METHODS", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 6738, "text": "Genomic DNA of each patient was extracted from peripheral blood using PureLink  Genomic DNA Mini Kit (Thermo Fisher Scientific, Carlsbad, CA, USA) and quantified using Qubit ds DNA HS Assay Kit on Qubit 2.0 Fluorimeter (Invitrogen, Carlsbad, CA, USA) according to the manufacturer's instructions. By Ion Ampliseq designer software (Version 7.0, Life Technologies, Carlsbad, CA, USA; ), we designed a multigene panel, including 25 genes involved in DNA damage repair pathways as DSBR and MMR, as well as in the cell cycle control. The selection of genes was based on their association with hereditary cancer predisposition. All the selected genes (APC, ATM, BRD1, BRIP1, CDH1, CDK4, CDKN2A, CHEK2, EPCAM, MLH1, MRE11, MSH2, MSH6, MUTYH, NBN, PALB2, PMS2, PTEN, RAD50, RAD51C, RAD51D, RECQL1, SMAD4, STK11, and TP53) are indeed considered cancer-predisposing genes with high or moderate penetrance based on the relative risk for BC, OC, and other malignancies that their damaging mutations confer in carriers (Table 1). The panel contains 610 primer pairs in two pools, covering the exons and exon-intron boundaries (Table S1). According to the manufacturer's protocol, libraries were carried out by emulsion PCR using Ion PGMTM (Personal Genome Machine)  Hi-Q  (Thermo Fisher Scientific, Carlsbad, CA, USA) View OT2 Kit (Thermo Fisher Scientific, Carlsbad, CA, USA) on Ion OneTouch 2 Instrument (Thermo Fisher Scientific, Carlsbad, CA, USA) and the Ion OneTouch ES (Enrichment System) (Thermo Fisher Scientific, Carlsbad, CA, USA) to produce high-quality Ion Sphere  particles for use in combination with the Ion PGM  Hi-Q  View Sequencing Kit (Thermo Fisher Scientific, Carlsbad, CA, USA). The prepared libraries were sequenced on Ion PGM  platform (Thermo Fisher Scientific, Carlsbad, CA, USA) using Ion 318  Chip v2 BC. Sequencing data analysis was performed using Torrent Suite version 5.0.5 and Ion Reporter version 5.6 (Thermo Fisher Scientific, Carlsbad, CA, USA). PGM sequencing produced an average of 269,000 reads per patient, the mean read length being 198 bp. The average read depth per sample was 474 reads, with a mean percentage of reads on target of 96%. The mean percentage of regions of interest (ROI), covered at least by 100x, was 96.5% with uniformity by 97.67%. Details for each sample of the sequencing metrics are reported in Table S2. Data analysis was performed by Ion Reporter Server System v5.12 (Thermo Fisher Scientific, Carlsbad, CA, USA) and visually confirmed with the Integrative Genomics Viewer (IGV, , Broad Institute and the Regents of the University of California, CA, USA). All variants reported in this paper, identified by NGS technology, were validated by Sanger sequencing.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37916", "infons": {"identifier": "324", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "30950", "valid": true, "normalized": [324], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 324, "biotype": "gene", "name": "APC", "accession": "@GENE_APC"}, "text": "APC", "locations": [{"offset": 7385, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37917", "infons": {"identifier": "472", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "30952", "valid": true, "normalized": [472], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 472, "biotype": "gene", "name": "ATM", "accession": "@GENE_ATM"}, "text": "ATM", "locations": [{"offset": 7390, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37918", "infons": {"identifier": "23774", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "40956", "valid": true, "normalized": [23774], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 23774, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRD1", "accession": "@GENE_BRD1"}, "text": "BRD1", "locations": [{"offset": 7395, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37919", "infons": {"identifier": "83990", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "32766", "valid": true, "normalized": [83990], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 83990, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRIP1", "accession": "@GENE_BRIP1"}, "text": "BRIP1", "locations": [{"offset": 7401, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37920", "infons": {"identifier": "999", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "20917", "valid": true, "normalized": [999], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 999, "biotype": "gene", "name": "CDH1", "accession": "@GENE_CDH1"}, "text": "CDH1", "locations": [{"offset": 7408, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37921", "infons": {"identifier": "1019", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "55429", "valid": true, "normalized": [1019], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 1019, "biotype": "gene", "name": "CDK4", "accession": "@GENE_CDK4"}, "text": "CDK4", "locations": [{"offset": 7414, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37922", "infons": {"identifier": "1029", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "55430", "valid": true, "normalized": [1029], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 1029, "biotype": "gene", "name": "CDKN2A", "accession": "@GENE_CDKN2A"}, "text": "CDKN2A", "locations": [{"offset": 7420, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "37923", "infons": {"identifier": "11200", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "38289", "valid": true, "normalized": [11200], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 11200, "biotype": "gene", "name": "CHEK2", "accession": "@GENE_CHEK2"}, "text": "CHEK2", "locations": [{"offset": 7428, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37924", "infons": {"identifier": "4072", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "1764", "valid": true, "normalized": [4072], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4072, "biotype": "gene", "name": "EPCAM", "accession": "@GENE_EPCAM"}, "text": "EPCAM", "locations": [{"offset": 7435, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37925", "infons": {"identifier": "4292", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "208", "valid": true, "normalized": [4292], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4292, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MLH1", "accession": "@GENE_MLH1"}, "text": "MLH1", "locations": [{"offset": 7442, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37926", "infons": {"identifier": "4361", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "4083", "valid": true, "normalized": [4361], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4361, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MRE11", "accession": "@GENE_MRE11"}, "text": "MRE11", "locations": [{"offset": 7448, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37927", "infons": {"identifier": "4436", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "210", "valid": true, "normalized": [4436], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4436, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MSH2", "accession": "@GENE_MSH2"}, "text": "MSH2", "locations": [{"offset": 7455, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37928", "infons": {"identifier": "2956", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "149", "valid": true, "normalized": [2956], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 2956, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MSH6", "accession": "@GENE_MSH6"}, "text": "MSH6", "locations": [{"offset": 7461, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37929", "infons": {"identifier": "4595", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "8156", "valid": true, "normalized": [4595], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4595, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MUTYH", "accession": "@GENE_MUTYH"}, "text": "MUTYH", "locations": [{"offset": 7467, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37930", "infons": {"identifier": "4683", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "1858", "valid": true, "normalized": [4683], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4683, "biotype": "gene", "name": "NBN", "accession": "@GENE_NBN"}, "text": "NBN", "locations": [{"offset": 7474, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37931", "infons": {"identifier": "79728", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "11652", "valid": true, "normalized": [79728], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 79728, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PALB2", "accession": "@GENE_PALB2"}, "text": "PALB2", "locations": [{"offset": 7479, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37932", "infons": {"identifier": "5395", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "133560", "valid": true, "normalized": [5395], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5395, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PMS2", "accession": "@GENE_PMS2"}, "text": "PMS2", "locations": [{"offset": 7486, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37933", "infons": {"identifier": "5728", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "265", "valid": true, "normalized": [5728], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5728, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PTEN", "accession": "@GENE_PTEN"}, "text": "PTEN", "locations": [{"offset": 7492, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37934", "infons": {"identifier": "10111", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "38092", "valid": true, "normalized": [10111], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 10111, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RAD50", "accession": "@GENE_RAD50"}, "text": "RAD50", "locations": [{"offset": 7498, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37935", "infons": {"identifier": "5889", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "14238", "valid": true, "normalized": [5889], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5889, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RAD51C", "accession": "@GENE_RAD51C"}, "text": "RAD51C", "locations": [{"offset": 7505, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "37936", "infons": {"identifier": "5892", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "2156", "valid": true, "normalized": [5892], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5892, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RAD51D", "accession": "@GENE_RAD51D"}, "text": "RAD51D", "locations": [{"offset": 7513, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "37937", "infons": {"identifier": "5965", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "56279", "valid": true, "normalized": [5965], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5965, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RECQL", "accession": "@GENE_RECQL"}, "text": "RECQL1", "locations": [{"offset": 7521, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "37938", "infons": {"identifier": "4089", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "31310", "valid": true, "normalized": [4089], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4089, "biotype": "gene", "name": "SMAD4", "accession": "@GENE_SMAD4"}, "text": "SMAD4", "locations": [{"offset": 7529, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37939", "infons": {"identifier": "6794", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "393", "valid": true, "normalized": [6794], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 6794, "biotype": "gene", "name": "STK11", "accession": "@GENE_STK11"}, "text": "STK11", "locations": [{"offset": 7536, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37940", "infons": {"identifier": "7157", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "460", "valid": true, "normalized": [7157], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 7157, "biotype": "gene", "name": "TP53", "accession": "@GENE_TP53"}, "text": "TP53", "locations": [{"offset": 7547, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37941", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 7665, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37942", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "malignancies", "locations": [{"offset": 7683, "length": 12}]}, {"id": "37943", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 7669, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37944", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patient", "locations": [{"offset": 8765, "length": 7}]}, {"id": "37945", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 7338, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "37946", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 8556, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37947", "infons": {"identifier": "CVCL:Z232", "type": "CellLine", "valid": true, "normalized": ["Z232"], "database": "cvcl", "normalized_id": "Z232", "biotype": "cellline", "name": "Z232", "accession": null}, "text": "S2", "locations": [{"offset": 9093, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37948", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patient", "locations": [{"offset": 6758, "length": 7}]}, {"id": "37949", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 7575, "length": 6}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "METHODS", "type": "title_2"}, "offset": 9474, "text": "2.3. Variants' Classification", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "METHODS", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 9506, "text": "The evaluation of all identified variants was based on current evidence from the scientific literature, on gene-specific databases by LSDBs (Locus-Specific Mutation Databases)  and additionally by consulting ClinVar , dbSNP , Varsome , Genome Aggregation Database (gnomAD) , Exome Aggregation Consortium (ExAC). The clinical classification of the variants was carried out according to the American College of Medical Genetics and Genomics (ACMG) recommendations with the 5-tier system: benign (B), likely benign (LB), variant of uncertain significance (VUS), likely pathogenic (LP), pathogenic (P). Independently, the missense prediction programs SIFT  Mutation Taster , Provean , and the splice prediction tool Human Splicing Finder (HSF)  were queried. Genetic results were considered informative when patients carried LP or P variants, non-informative (NI) when B, LB, or VUS variants were found. Variants were reported using the Human Genome Variation Society nomenclature guidelines .", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37950", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "Human", "locations": [{"offset": 10439, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37951", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patients", "locations": [{"offset": 10310, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "37952", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "Human", "locations": [{"offset": 10218, "length": 5}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "METHODS", "type": "title_2"}, "offset": 10516, "text": "2.4. Statistical Analysis", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "METHODS", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 10542, "text": "A comparison of demographic and clinical variables between groups was performed with unpaired t-test and Fisher test for continuous and categorical data, respectively. The p-values lower than or equal to 0.05 were considered statistically significant.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "RESULTS", "type": "title_1"}, "offset": 10794, "text": "3. Results", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "RESULTS", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 10805, "text": "From January 2017 to December 2019, a total of 113 (104 F/9 M) eligible patients, with personal and/or familial history of BC/OC and PC, who satisfied the NCCN testing criteria for the multigene panel, were included (Table 2). Among them, 87 were females with BC (77%) (fBC, mean age at onset 49.25 +- 10.35; range 30-82), including 12 cases with bilateral BC and nine with at least a second different primary cancer, seven were males with BC (6.2%) (mBC, 60.7 +- 13.2; 43-76), nine (8%) had OC (8%) (52.33 +- 14.04; 28-68), and three had PC (2.6%, 1F/2M; 65.3 +- 0.6; 65-66). The remaining seven probands (6.2%), all women, had other types of cancers (melanoma, Mullerian sarcoma, thyroid papilloma) and/or malignancies in their relatives. Overall, 107/113 cases (94.7%) referred a positive family history for BC, OC, prostatic cancer (PrC), PC, and/or other types of malignancies in one or more relatives (Table 2).", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37953", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 11065, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37954", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010195", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010195"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010195", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Pancreatitis", "accession": "@DISEASE_Pancreatitis"}, "text": "PC", "locations": [{"offset": 11648, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37955", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:C537371", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["C537371"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "C537371", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Mullerian aplasia", "accession": "@DISEASE_Mullerian_aplasia"}, "text": "Mullerian sarcoma", "locations": [{"offset": 11468, "length": 17}]}, {"id": "37956", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D008545", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D008545"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D008545", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Melanoma", "accession": "@DISEASE_Melanoma"}, "text": "melanoma", "locations": [{"offset": 11458, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "37957", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D018567", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D018567"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D018567", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms Male", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms_Male"}, "text": "mBC", "locations": [{"offset": 11256, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37958", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010195", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010195"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010195", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Pancreatitis", "accession": "@DISEASE_Pancreatitis"}, "text": "PC", "locations": [{"offset": 10938, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37959", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patients", "locations": [{"offset": 10877, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "37960", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 11616, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37961", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 11297, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37962", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 10931, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37963", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010212", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010212"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010212", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Papilloma", "accession": "@DISEASE_Papilloma"}, "text": "thyroid papilloma", "locations": [{"offset": 11487, "length": 17}]}, {"id": "37964", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 11215, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "37965", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 11162, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37966", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "NCCN", "locations": [{"offset": 10960, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37967", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010195", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010195"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010195", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Pancreatitis", "accession": "@DISEASE_Pancreatitis"}, "text": "PC", "locations": [{"offset": 11344, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37968", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 10928, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37969", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "fBC", "locations": [{"offset": 11075, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37970", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "women", "locations": [{"offset": 11423, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37971", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D011471", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D011471"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D011471", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Prostatic Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Prostatic_Neoplasms"}, "text": "PrC", "locations": [{"offset": 11642, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37972", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "malignancies", "locations": [{"offset": 11513, "length": 12}]}, {"id": "37973", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "cancers", "locations": [{"offset": 11449, "length": 7}]}, {"id": "37974", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "malignancies", "locations": [{"offset": 11674, "length": 12}]}, {"id": "37975", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 11620, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37976", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D011471", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D011471"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D011471", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Prostatic Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Prostatic_Neoplasms"}, "text": "prostatic cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 11624, "length": 16}]}, {"id": "37977", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 11245, "length": 2}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "RESULTS", "type": "title_2"}, "offset": 11731, "text": "3.1. Multigene Panel Results", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "RESULTS", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 11760, "text": "In 16/113 BRCA1/2-negative index cases (14%), we identified LP/P variants, whereas 23 probands were the carrier of VUS (20%). The remaining 74 (66%) had no damaging mutations or VUS (Figure 1a). Excluding the B/LB variants, we identified 43 unique variants in 18 of 25 analyzed genes. They included 33 (77%) missense, six (14%) intronic, two (5%) frameshift, one splicing mutation (2%), and one synonym variants (2%). Fourteen unique variants (33.3%), found in five genes involved in DSBR-HR, MMR, cell cycle regulation, and in the DNA repair helicase gene RECQL, were classified as P/LP. In particular, six were detected in the CHEK2 gene, three in RAD51C, two in ATM, while single variants P/LP were detected in RECQL, MLH1, and MSH2 genes. The pathogenic variant c.363_364del in the RECQL gene has not been previously reported. The remaining 29 identified variants were VUS (67%), four of which, found in RAD50, BRIP1, and ATM, were new (Figure 1a,b, Table 3). All the 16 probands had malignancies: 10 had BC, two OC, one PC, and the remaining three melanoma, Mullerian sarcoma, and thyroid papilloma, respectively. No asymptomatic probands were found with damaging mutations. Clinical features and family history of the patients carrying pathogenic variants identified in this study are summarized in Table 4.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "37978", "infons": {"identifier": "5965", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "56279", "valid": true, "normalized": [5965], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5965, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RECQL", "accession": "@GENE_RECQL"}, "text": "RECQL", "locations": [{"offset": 12317, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37979", "infons": {"identifier": "11200", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "38289", "valid": true, "normalized": [11200], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 11200, "biotype": "gene", "name": "CHEK2", "accession": "@GENE_CHEK2"}, "text": "CHEK2", "locations": [{"offset": 12389, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37980", "infons": {"identifier": "5889", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "14238", "valid": true, "normalized": [5889], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5889, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RAD51C", "accession": "@GENE_RAD51C"}, "text": "RAD51C", "locations": [{"offset": 12410, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "37981", "infons": {"identifier": "472", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "30952", "valid": true, "normalized": [472], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 472, "biotype": "gene", "name": "ATM", "accession": "@GENE_ATM"}, "text": "ATM", "locations": [{"offset": 12425, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37982", "infons": {"identifier": "5965", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "56279", "valid": true, "normalized": [5965], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5965, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RECQL", "accession": "@GENE_RECQL"}, "text": "RECQL", "locations": [{"offset": 12474, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37983", "infons": {"identifier": "4292", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "208", "valid": true, "normalized": [4292], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4292, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MLH1", "accession": "@GENE_MLH1"}, "text": "MLH1", "locations": [{"offset": 12481, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37984", "infons": {"identifier": "4436", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "210", "valid": true, "normalized": [4436], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4436, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MSH2", "accession": "@GENE_MSH2"}, "text": "MSH2", "locations": [{"offset": 12491, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37985", "infons": {"identifier": "5965", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "56279", "valid": true, "normalized": [5965], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5965, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RECQL", "accession": "@GENE_RECQL"}, "text": "RECQL", "locations": [{"offset": 12546, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37986", "infons": {"identifier": "10111", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "38092", "valid": true, "normalized": [10111], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 10111, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RAD50", "accession": "@GENE_RAD50"}, "text": "RAD50", "locations": [{"offset": 12668, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37987", "infons": {"identifier": "83990", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "32766", "valid": true, "normalized": [83990], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 83990, "biotype": "gene", "name": "BRIP1", "accession": "@GENE_BRIP1"}, "text": "BRIP1", "locations": [{"offset": 12675, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "37988", "infons": {"identifier": "472", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "30952", "valid": true, "normalized": [472], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 472, "biotype": "gene", "name": "ATM", "accession": "@GENE_ATM"}, "text": "ATM", "locations": [{"offset": 12686, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37989", "infons": {"identifier": "5744", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "2113", "valid": true, "normalized": [5744], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5744, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PTHLH", "accession": "@GENE_PTHLH"}, "text": "P/LP", "locations": [{"offset": 12452, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37990", "infons": {"identifier": "5744", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "2113", "valid": true, "normalized": [5744], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5744, "biotype": "gene", "name": "PTHLH", "accession": "@GENE_PTHLH"}, "text": "P/LP", "locations": [{"offset": 12343, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37991", "infons": {"identifier": "164045", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "87103", "valid": true, "normalized": [164045], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 164045, "biotype": "gene", "name": "HFM1", "accession": "@GENE_HFM1"}, "text": "helicase", "locations": [{"offset": 12303, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "37992", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patients", "locations": [{"offset": 12984, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "37993", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D002972", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D002972"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D002972", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Cleft Palate", "accession": "@DISEASE_Cleft_Palate"}, "text": "LP/P", "locations": [{"offset": 11820, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "37994", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D065309", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D065309"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D065309", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Atypical Squamous Cells of the Cervix", "accession": "@DISEASE_Atypical_Squamous_Cells_of_the_Cervix"}, "text": "VUS", "locations": [{"offset": 11938, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37995", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D008545", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D008545"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D008545", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Melanoma", "accession": "@DISEASE_Melanoma"}, "text": "melanoma", "locations": [{"offset": 12813, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "37996", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 12777, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "37997", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D065309", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D065309"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D065309", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Atypical Squamous Cells of the Cervix", "accession": "@DISEASE_Atypical_Squamous_Cells_of_the_Cervix"}, "text": "VUS", "locations": [{"offset": 11875, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "37998", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:c|DEL|363_364|;HGVS:c.363_364del;VariantGroup:91;CorrespondingGene:5965;CorrespondingSpecies:9606", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "DNAMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "c.363_364del", "gene_ids": [5965], "gene_id": 5965, "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "rsids": [], "normalized": ["#5965#c.363_364del", "#5965#"], "normalized_id": "#5965#c.363_364del", "biotype": "variant", "name": "c.363_364del", "accession": "@VARIANT_c.363_364del_RECQL_human"}, "text": "c.363_364del", "locations": [{"offset": 12526, "length": 12}]}, {"id": "37999", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010195", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010195"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010195", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Pancreatitis", "accession": "@DISEASE_Pancreatitis"}, "text": "PC", "locations": [{"offset": 12785, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38000", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "malignancies", "locations": [{"offset": 12748, "length": 12}]}, {"id": "38001", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D065309", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D065309"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D065309", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Atypical Squamous Cells of the Cervix", "accession": "@DISEASE_Atypical_Squamous_Cells_of_the_Cervix"}, "text": "VUS", "locations": [{"offset": 12633, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "38002", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010212", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010212"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010212", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Papilloma", "accession": "@DISEASE_Papilloma"}, "text": "thyroid papilloma", "locations": [{"offset": 12846, "length": 17}]}, {"id": "38004", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 12769, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38006", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:C537371", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["C537371"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "C537371", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Mullerian aplasia", "accession": "@DISEASE_Mullerian_aplasia"}, "text": "Mullerian sarcoma", "locations": [{"offset": 12823, "length": 17}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "RESULTS", "type": "title_2"}, "offset": 13074, "text": "3.2. DSBs-HR Genes Variants and Related Phenotypes", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "38007", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D019457", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D019457"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D019457", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Chromosome Breakage", "accession": "@DISEASE_Chromosome_Breakage"}, "text": "DSBs", "locations": [{"offset": 13079, "length": 4}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "RESULTS", "type": "title_3"}, "offset": 13125, "text": "3.2.1. ATM", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "RESULTS", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 13136, "text": "The LP ATM variant c.875C>T was indeed detected in a 44-year-old woman (P29) with a well-differentiated and hormone-responsive in situ ductal carcinoma (DCIS) diagnosed at 43 years, who had removed a melanoma a year before. Melanoma, osteosarcoma, head-neck, brain, and uterine cancers were referred in her paternal relatives (Figure S1c). NGS analysis in this patient also detected a VUS c.377C>T, p.(Pro126Leu) in RECQL. The ATM c.875C>T, p.(Pro292Leu), is a rare variant detected in 0.01% of the general population (ExAC source). Although located in a protein domain with unknown function, it has been described in a compound heterozygous state in AT cases. Functional studies have demonstrated a low level of the protein, absent or reduced functional kinase activity, and high radio-sensitivity after ionizing radiation exposure of cells carrying this mutation.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "38008", "infons": {"identifier": "472", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "30952", "valid": true, "normalized": [472], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 472, "biotype": "gene", "name": "ATM", "accession": "@GENE_ATM"}, "text": "ATM", "locations": [{"offset": 13143, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "38009", "infons": {"identifier": "5965", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "56279", "valid": true, "normalized": [5965], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5965, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RECQL", "accession": "@GENE_RECQL"}, "text": "RECQL", "locations": [{"offset": 13552, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "38010", "infons": {"identifier": "472", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "30952", "valid": true, "normalized": [472], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 472, "biotype": "gene", "name": "ATM", "accession": "@GENE_ATM"}, "text": "ATM", "locations": [{"offset": 13563, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "38011", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:c|SUB|C|377|T;HGVS:c.377C>T;VariantGroup:4;CorrespondingGene:5965;RS#:1267616869;CorrespondingSpecies:9606", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "DNAMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "c.377C>T", "gene_ids": [5965], "gene_id": 5965, "rsids": ["rs1267616869"], "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "rsid": "rs1267616869", "normalized": ["rs1267616869##", "#5965#"], "normalized_id": "rs1267616869##", "biotype": "variant", "name": "c.377C>T", "accession": "@VARIANT_c.377C>T_RECQL_human"}, "text": "c.377C>T", "locations": [{"offset": 13525, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "38012", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:C537419", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["C537419"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "C537419", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Bohring syndrome", "accession": "@DISEASE_Bohring_syndrome"}, "text": "LP", "locations": [{"offset": 13140, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38013", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D008545", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D008545"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D008545", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Melanoma", "accession": "@DISEASE_Melanoma"}, "text": "melanoma", "locations": [{"offset": 13336, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "38014", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patient", "locations": [{"offset": 13497, "length": 7}]}, {"id": "38015", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D008545", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D008545"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D008545", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Melanoma", "accession": "@DISEASE_Melanoma"}, "text": "Melanoma", "locations": [{"offset": 13360, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "38016", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:c|SUB|C|875|T;HGVS:c.875C>T;VariantGroup:17;CorrespondingGene:472;RS#:747727055;CorrespondingSpecies:9606;CA#:6264689", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "DNAMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "c.875C>T", "gene_ids": [472], "gene_id": 472, "rsids": ["rs747727055"], "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "clingen_id": "CA6264689", "rsid": "rs747727055", "normalized": ["rs747727055##", "#472#", "CA6264689#rs747727055##"], "normalized_id": "rs747727055##", "biotype": "variant", "name": "c.875C>T", "accession": "@VARIANT_p.P292L_ATM_human"}, "text": "c.875C>T", "locations": [{"offset": 13567, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "38017", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001260", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001260"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001260", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ataxia Telangiectasia", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ataxia_Telangiectasia"}, "text": "AT", "locations": [{"offset": 13787, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38018", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D002285", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D002285"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D002285", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Carcinoma Intraductal Noninfiltrating", "accession": "@DISEASE_Carcinoma_Intraductal_Noninfiltrating"}, "text": "hormone-responsive in situ ductal carcinoma", "locations": [{"offset": 13244, "length": 43}]}, {"id": "38019", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D002285", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D002285"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D002285", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Carcinoma Intraductal Noninfiltrating", "accession": "@DISEASE_Carcinoma_Intraductal_Noninfiltrating"}, "text": "DCIS", "locations": [{"offset": 13289, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "38020", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D012516", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D012516"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D012516", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Osteosarcoma", "accession": "@DISEASE_Osteosarcoma"}, "text": "osteosarcoma", "locations": [{"offset": 13370, "length": 12}]}, {"id": "38021", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D006258", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D006258"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D006258", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Head and Neck Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Head_and_Neck_Neoplasms"}, "text": "head-neck, brain, and uterine cancers", "locations": [{"offset": 13384, "length": 37}]}, {"id": "38022", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:c|SUB|C|875|T;HGVS:c.875C>T;VariantGroup:17;CorrespondingGene:472;RS#:747727055;CorrespondingSpecies:9606;CA#:6264689", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "DNAMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "c.875C>T", "gene_ids": [472], "gene_id": 472, "rsids": ["rs747727055"], "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "clingen_id": "CA6264689", "rsid": "rs747727055", "normalized": ["rs747727055##", "#472#", "CA6264689#rs747727055##"], "normalized_id": "rs747727055##", "biotype": "variant", "name": "c.875C>T", "accession": "@VARIANT_p.P292L_ATM_human"}, "text": "c.875C>T", "locations": [{"offset": 13155, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "38023", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "woman", "locations": [{"offset": 13201, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "38024", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:p|SUB|P|292|L;HGVS:p.P292L;VariantGroup:17;CorrespondingGene:472;RS#:747727055;CorrespondingSpecies:9606;CA#:6264689", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "ProteinMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "p.P292L", "gene_ids": [472], "gene_id": 472, "rsids": ["rs747727055"], "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "clingen_id": "CA6264689", "rsid": "rs747727055", "normalized": ["rs747727055##", "#472#", "CA6264689#rs747727055##"], "normalized_id": "rs747727055##", "biotype": "variant", "name": "p.P292L", "accession": "@VARIANT_p.P292L_ATM_human"}, "text": "p.(Pro292Leu)", "locations": [{"offset": 13577, "length": 13}]}, {"id": "38025", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:p|SUB|P|126|L;HGVS:p.P126L;VariantGroup:4;CorrespondingGene:5965;RS#:1267616869;CorrespondingSpecies:9606", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "ProteinMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "p.P126L", "gene_ids": [5965], "gene_id": 5965, "rsids": ["rs1267616869"], "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "rsid": "rs1267616869", "normalized": ["rs1267616869##", "#5965#"], "normalized_id": "rs1267616869##", "biotype": "variant", "name": "p.P126L", "accession": "@VARIANT_c.377C>T_RECQL_human"}, "text": "p.(Pro126Leu)", "locations": [{"offset": 13535, "length": 13}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "RESULTS", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 14002, "text": "The patient (P89) carrying the pathogenic ATM variant c.3576G>A had pancreatic cancer at 66 years of age. Twenty-one years earlier, he underwent surgery for a GC. In addition, his brother, his father, and seven of his paternal uncles deceased by GC (Figure 2b). The c.3576G>A substitution is a synonymous variant (p.Lys1192=), which, located in the last base of exon 26, leads to exon skipping and inframe deletion (p.Ser1135_Lys1192del). Very rare in the general population (GnomAD, f = 1.59 x 10-6), the c.3576G>A has been described in many unrelated Italian AT patients with founder effect.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "38026", "infons": {"identifier": "472", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "30952", "valid": true, "normalized": [472], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 472, "biotype": "gene", "name": "ATM", "accession": "@GENE_ATM"}, "text": "ATM", "locations": [{"offset": 14044, "length": 3}]}, {"id": "38027", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:p|DEL|1135_,1192|K;HGVS:p.K1135_,1192del;VariantGroup:104;CorrespondingGene:675;CorrespondingSpecies:9606", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "ProteinMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "p.K1135_,1192del", "gene_ids": [675], "gene_id": 675, "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "rsids": [], "normalized": ["#675#p.K1135_,1192del", "#675#"], "normalized_id": "#675#p.K1135_,1192del", "biotype": "variant", "name": "p.K1135_,1192del", "accession": null}, "text": "p.Ser1135_Lys1192del", "locations": [{"offset": 14418, "length": 20}]}, {"id": "38028", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010190", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010190"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010190", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Pancreatic Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Pancreatic_Neoplasms"}, "text": "pancreatic cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 14070, "length": 17}]}, {"id": "38029", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:p|SUB|K|1192|=;HGVS:p.K1192=;VariantGroup:42;CorrespondingGene:675;CorrespondingSpecies:9606", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "ProteinMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "p.K1192=", "gene_ids": [675], "gene_id": 675, "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "rsids": [], "normalized": ["#675#p.K1192=", "#675#"], "normalized_id": "#675#p.K1192=", "biotype": "variant", "name": "p.K1192=", "accession": "@VARIANT_p.K1192=_BRCA2_human"}, "text": "p.Lys1192=", "locations": [{"offset": 14316, "length": 10}]}, {"id": "38030", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patient", "locations": [{"offset": 14006, "length": 7}]}, {"id": "38031", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:c|SUB|G|3576|A;HGVS:c.3576G>A;VariantGroup:14;CorrespondingGene:472;RS#:587776551;CorrespondingSpecies:9606;CA#:193897", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "DNAMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "c.3576G>A", "gene_ids": [472], "gene_id": 472, "rsids": ["rs587776551"], "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "clingen_id": "CA193897", "rsid": "rs587776551", "normalized": ["rs587776551##", "#472#", "CA193897#rs587776551##"], "normalized_id": "rs587776551##", "biotype": "variant", "name": "c.3576G>A", "accession": "@VARIANT_c.3576G>A_ATM_human"}, "text": "c.3576G>A", "locations": [{"offset": 14508, "length": 9}]}, {"id": "38032", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:c|SUB|G|3576|A;HGVS:c.3576G>A;VariantGroup:14;CorrespondingGene:472;RS#:587776551;CorrespondingSpecies:9606;CA#:193897", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "DNAMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "c.3576G>A", "gene_ids": [472], "gene_id": 472, "rsids": ["rs587776551"], "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "clingen_id": "CA193897", "rsid": "rs587776551", "normalized": ["rs587776551##", "#472#", "CA193897#rs587776551##"], "normalized_id": "rs587776551##", "biotype": "variant", "name": "c.3576G>A", "accession": "@VARIANT_c.3576G>A_ATM_human"}, "text": "c.3576G>A", "locations": [{"offset": 14268, "length": 9}]}, {"id": "38033", "infons": {"type": "Disease", "valid": false, "normalized_id": null, "biotype": "disease"}, "text": "GC", "locations": [{"offset": 14248, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38034", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patients", "locations": [{"offset": 14566, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "38035", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:c|SUB|G|3576|A;HGVS:c.3576G>A;VariantGroup:14;CorrespondingGene:472;RS#:587776551;CorrespondingSpecies:9606;CA#:193897", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "DNAMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "c.3576G>A", "gene_ids": [472], "gene_id": 472, "rsids": ["rs587776551"], "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "clingen_id": "CA193897", "rsid": "rs587776551", "normalized": ["rs587776551##", "#472#", "CA193897#rs587776551##"], "normalized_id": "rs587776551##", "biotype": "variant", "name": "c.3576G>A", "accession": "@VARIANT_c.3576G>A_ATM_human"}, "text": "c.3576G>A", "locations": [{"offset": 14056, "length": 9}]}, {"id": "38036", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001260", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001260"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001260", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ataxia Telangiectasia", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ataxia_Telangiectasia"}, "text": "AT", "locations": [{"offset": 14563, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38037", "infons": {"type": "Disease", "valid": false, "normalized_id": null, "biotype": "disease"}, "text": "GC", "locations": [{"offset": 14161, "length": 2}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "RESULTS", "type": "title_3"}, "offset": 14600, "text": "3.2.2. RAD51C", "sentences": [], "annotations": [], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "RESULTS", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 14614, "text": "LP variants in the RAD51C gene were found in a woman with bilateral BC and in two women with OC. The c.904+5G>T splice site variant was found in a patient with OC diagnosed at 40 years (P113). She referred OC also in her two paternal cousins, while her father and her mother had non-Hodgkin lymphoma and thyroid cancer, respectively (Figure S1b). The c.904+5G>T, described in BC and OC patients and families and in 0.002% of the general population (ExAC source), involves a consensus splice site of intron 6. Functional studies indicate that this variant causes aberrant mRNA splicing and the exon 6 skipping, leading to premature termination codon and a consequent truncated protein, p.(Val280Glyfs*11).", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "38038", "infons": {"identifier": "5889", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "14238", "valid": true, "normalized": [5889], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5889, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RAD51C", "accession": "@GENE_RAD51C"}, "text": "RAD51C", "locations": [{"offset": 14633, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "38039", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patient", "locations": [{"offset": 14761, "length": 7}]}, {"id": "38040", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D008228", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D008228"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D008228", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Lymphoma Non-Hodgkin", "accession": "@DISEASE_Lymphoma_Non_Hodgkin"}, "text": "non-Hodgkin lymphoma", "locations": [{"offset": 14893, "length": 20}]}, {"id": "38041", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:c|SUB|G|904+5|T;HGVS:c.904+5G>T;VariantGroup:33;CorrespondingGene:5889;RS#:587782702;CorrespondingSpecies:9606;CA#:169350", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "DNAMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "c.904+5G>T", "gene_ids": [5889], "gene_id": 5889, "rsids": ["rs587782702"], "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "clingen_id": "CA169350", "rsid": "rs587782702", "normalized": ["rs587782702##", "#5889#", "CA169350#rs587782702##"], "normalized_id": "rs587782702##", "biotype": "variant", "name": "c.904+5G>T", "accession": "@VARIANT_c.904+5G>T_RAD51C_human"}, "text": "c.904+5G>T", "locations": [{"offset": 14715, "length": 10}]}, {"id": "38042", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "patients", "locations": [{"offset": 15000, "length": 8}]}, {"id": "38043", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "woman", "locations": [{"offset": 14661, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "38044", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 14774, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38045", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 14707, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38046", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 14682, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38047", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 14990, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38048", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 14820, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38049", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D013964", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D013964"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D013964", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Thyroid Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Thyroid_Neoplasms"}, "text": "thyroid cancer", "locations": [{"offset": 14918, "length": 14}]}, {"id": "38050", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 14997, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38051", "infons": {"identifier": "tmVar:c|SUB|G|904+5|T;HGVS:c.904+5G>T;VariantGroup:33;CorrespondingGene:5889;RS#:587782702;CorrespondingSpecies:9606;CA#:169350", "type": "Variant", "valid": true, "subtype": "DNAMutation", "database": "litvar", "hgvs": "c.904+5G>T", "gene_ids": [5889], "gene_id": 5889, "rsids": ["rs587782702"], "species_ids": [9606], "species_id": 9606, "clingen_id": "CA169350", "rsid": "rs587782702", "normalized": ["rs587782702##", "#5889#", "CA169350#rs587782702##"], "normalized_id": "rs587782702##", "biotype": "variant", "name": "c.904+5G>T", "accession": "@VARIANT_c.904+5G>T_RAD51C_human"}, "text": "c.904+5G>T", "locations": [{"offset": 14965, "length": 10}]}, {"id": "38052", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:C537419", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["C537419"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "C537419", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Bohring syndrome", "accession": "@DISEASE_Bohring_syndrome"}, "text": "LP", "locations": [{"offset": 14614, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38053", "infons": {"identifier": "9606", "type": "Species", "valid": true, "normalized": [9606], "database": "ncbi_taxonomy", "normalized_id": 9606, "biotype": "species", "name": "9606", "accession": null}, "text": "women", "locations": [{"offset": 14696, "length": 5}]}], "relations": []}, {"infons": {"section_type": "RESULTS", "type": "paragraph"}, "offset": 15319, "text": "The c.934C>T variant was identified in a bilateral metachronous BC case (P33), who carried also an MSH2 VUS (c.1847C>G, p.(Pro616Arg). The lobular carcinoma at the left side was diagnosed at 35 years of age, whereas the high-grade triple-negative invasive DC (Ductal Carcinoma) occurred after 11 years. The father presented a BC at 54 years and, more recently, a PrC; a paternal uncle had three primary malignancies (cerebral, prostatic, and bladder cancers), whereas the mother and the grandmother had a CC and a BC, respectively (Figure S1a). The mutation analysis, extended to the parents, confirmed the maternal origin of both variants. The c.934C>T, p.(Arg312Trp), a non-conservative change at the ATPase domain of RAD51C described in OC cases, has been demonstrated to impair protein function. In functional studies, indeed, the presence of this amino acidic substitution has been related to higher levels of DNA damage, altered RAD51 foci formation upon irradiation, and increased chromosomal instability.", "sentences": [], "annotations": [{"id": "38054", "infons": {"identifier": "4436", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "210", "valid": true, "normalized": [4436], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 4436, "biotype": "gene", "name": "MSH2", "accession": "@GENE_MSH2"}, "text": "MSH2", "locations": [{"offset": 15418, "length": 4}]}, {"id": "38055", "infons": {"identifier": "1769", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "1049", "valid": true, "normalized": [1769], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 1769, "biotype": "gene", "name": "DNAH8", "accession": "@GENE_DNAH8"}, "text": "ATPase", "locations": [{"offset": 16022, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "38056", "infons": {"identifier": "5889", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "14238", "valid": true, "normalized": [5889], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5889, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RAD51C", "accession": "@GENE_RAD51C"}, "text": "RAD51C", "locations": [{"offset": 16039, "length": 6}]}, {"id": "38057", "infons": {"identifier": "5888", "type": "Gene", "ncbi_homologene": "2155", "valid": true, "normalized": [5888], "database": "ncbi_gene", "normalized_id": 5888, "biotype": "gene", "name": "RAD51", "accession": "@GENE_RAD51"}, "text": "RAD51", "locations": [{"offset": 16254, "length": 5}]}, {"id": "38058", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D011471", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D011471"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D011471", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Prostatic Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Prostatic_Neoplasms"}, "text": "cerebral, prostatic, and bladder cancers", "locations": [{"offset": 15736, "length": 40}]}, {"id": "38059", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D009369", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D009369"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D009369", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Neoplasms"}, "text": "malignancies", "locations": [{"offset": 15722, "length": 12}]}, {"id": "38060", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D044584", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D044584"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D044584", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Carcinoma Ductal", "accession": "@DISEASE_Carcinoma_Ductal"}, "text": "Ductal Carcinoma", "locations": [{"offset": 15579, "length": 16}]}, {"id": "38061", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 15833, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38062", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D018275", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D018275"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D018275", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Carcinoma Lobular", "accession": "@DISEASE_Carcinoma_Lobular"}, "text": "lobular carcinoma", "locations": [{"offset": 15458, "length": 17}]}, {"id": "38063", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D010051", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D010051"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D010051", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Ovarian Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Ovarian_Neoplasms"}, "text": "OC", "locations": [{"offset": 16059, "length": 2}]}, {"id": "38064", "infons": {"identifier": "MESH:D001943", "type": "Disease", "valid": true, "normalized": ["D001943"], "database": "ncbi_mesh", "normalized_id": "D001943", "biotype": "disease", "name": "Breast Neoplasms", "accession": "@DISEASE_Breast_Neoplasms"}, "text": "BC", "locations": [{"offset": 15645, "length": 2}]}, {"id":